  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Hubert Freidl is an Austrian businessman who led Lyoness and myWorld, developing an international network of merchants and shoppers. Born in Graz and trained in wholesale trade, he worked in insurance and software before building the shopping-rewards business. He subsequently established Salters Advisory in Dubai, advising founders on business structure and expansion.",
    "confidence": {
      "score": 84,
